# Keep this list SHORT. A path here costs a few seconds on every commit that
# touches it; a list that grows to cover everything gets routed around with
# EHEL_COMMIT_REVIEWED=1 as a reflex, and then it protects nothing.
#
# Add a path when two sessions are genuinely working in one file at once.
# Remove it when they are not.

